nd  unfortunately he met a very very bad  demise from the scarlet witch in the  film along with the rest of the  illuminati and side note reed richards  did say that he has children and that  his wife is still alive of course that  would be sue storm and in the comics his  son is franklin richards one of the most  powerful mutants ever an omega level  mutant so i have to wonder if his son is  ever going to seek revenge on the death  of his father and start to travel the  multiverse but i'll talk about that  another time let's talk about what  patrick stewart has recently said about  returning to play professor x again in a  recent interview with variety patrick  stewart talked about his future as  professor x he confirmed that after star  trek picard season 3 he is done playing  john luke picard but he is keeping his  options open for professor x in the  interview he said charles xavier yeah  there may be you know the whole x-men  comic series is so huge so vast there  might be an opportunity in which he  comes back we'll see this is incredible  news and yes he did die in multiverse of  madness but hey we know the multiverse  contains multiple professor xavier's so  patrick stewart could return as any one  of those and hopefully they can stop  killing him i'm tired of watching him  die on screen this should be the last  death that we have to see but maybe he  could even play the main professor  xavier in the main mcu now i have to  admit he is pretty old to be playing  this character that might require a  pretty big commitment of 10 plus years  probably 15 plus years plus they'll  probably want a younger professor xavier  but hey the multiverse is now a part of  the mcu in a very big way and it looks  like there's going to be more  multiversal hopping in loki and probably  a lot of other projects coming so  perhaps we see him again as professor  xavier in another universe relatively  soon in the mcu i personally really  would love to see this and maybe he  could eve